  "description": {
    "raw": "You temporarily alter the color of your skin, hide, or scales to\nanother option legal for your race. You take no penalty for using\nDisguise to appear as a member of a different race as long as that\nrace has the same type and color of skin, hide, or scales as you.",
    "search_text": "\"you temporarily alter the color of your skin, hide, or scales to\\nanother option legal for your race. you take no penalty for using\\ndisguise to appear as a member of a different race as long as that\\nrace has the same type and color of skin, hide, or scales as you.\"",
